# The gallery pass with TailorMade absent altogether (config/gallery-notm/ holds no seed for it: a seed naming a mod that is not staged stops the staging).
# The gallery pass: the Sanctuaire de Nelim fixture (PickleTools/docs/GALERIE.md) plus the legless body retexture and AB's trousers.
# AB needs its seeded settings: config/gallery/ is a copy of config/wdi-ab/.
#   Submit-PickleRun.ps1 -Mod VenusTouchWaistlines -DepMap wsl-deps.gallery.map -Filter "@gallery" ...
# Female Body Variants and Female Apparel Variants load BEFORE WDI (WDI declares loadAfter on both): after it, their own Naked_*_Female textures shadow WDI's.
